y: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; margin-left: 35.7pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">추가이수과정 이수 불가시 졸업할 수 없음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -33.5pt; margin-left: 33.5pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">복수전공을 부전공으로 변경하고자 할 때에는 이수 성적이 평점평균 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3.00</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">이상 이어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -33.2pt; margin-left: 33.2pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">추가이수과정을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; margin-left: 35.7pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">복수전공에서 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 부전공학점으로 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -35pt; margin-left: 35pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 2010</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학년도 이전에 수강한 과목은 이수구분 변경기간에 변경신청하시기 바람</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -35pt; margin-left: 35pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-paginati